#: 278a286a4f924719a97298840099bc39
msgid "Documentation workflow"
msgstr "文档工作流"

#: 1aeb0f6cf9764edf912790f898437503
msgid ""
"English MyST Markdown under `docs/` is the only Sphinx source. Simplified "
"Chinese translations live in gettext catalogs under "
"`docs/locales/zh_CN/LC_MESSAGES`; do not add a parallel Chinese source tree."
msgstr ""

#: 0a73c746299d4b9a92e38ccf66f9a905
msgid ""
"Install the pinned Python 3.11 documentation environment and run the public "
"gates through nox:"
msgstr ""

#: 65ebedadb1d249aaaa2ae03ced11e10f
msgid ""
"`docs` and `docs_zh` build the current checkout as a wheel, install that "
"wheel in an isolated nox environment, and reject an autodoc import from the "
"source tree. HTML, gettext templates, compiled catalogs, doctrees, and "
"generated notebooks are written below `JITTOR_LAB_ROOT/_state`, never into "
"the checkout."
msgstr ""

#: 213d0c04ed2f45e3af1594e40a0554ed
msgid "Update a translation"
msgstr ""

#: 365055816a474b93b46cccbb1366730f
msgid ""
"After editing English source, extract messages into external state and "
"update a temporary catalog copy:"
msgstr ""

#: 260b3c6dbb6048de8628aca86ce9063d
msgid ""
"Review the catalog diff, apply the intended `msgstr` updates to tracked "
"`.po` files, then run `python -m nox -s docs_zh`. The session repeats "
"extraction on a copy and fails if catalogs are stale, fuzzy, or obsolete. "
"`.pot`, `.mo`, and HTML files are generated products and must not be "
"committed."
msgstr ""

#: 163e5e72681d4c7c973df58d2a9bebb8
msgid "External inventories"
msgstr ""

#: f452e275f1874948bf1413662e5e4816
msgid ""
"Strict Sphinx builds resolve Python, NumPy, and PyTorch references against "
"the projects' official intersphinx inventories. Documentation CI is network-"
"enabled for these three authoritative files, uses a bounded timeout, and "
"treats an unavailable inventory as a failed strict build. `docs_links` is "
"the deterministic, offline pull-request check for repository-internal "
"Markdown, images, MyST roles, and toctrees; arbitrary external URL crawling "
"is not part of that gate."
msgstr ""
